Threat Hunting Report
Threat Hunting Report:
On 2025-08-18, the SOC conducted a proactive hunt for unauthorized privilege escalation.
Logs from Elastic Security were analyzed for Event ID 4672 indicating elevated privileges.
Suspicious accounts were identified, and T1078 (Valid Accounts) misuse was mapped using MITRE ATT&CK.
AlienVault OTX was used to cross-reference IOCs, revealing connections from anomalous IPs.
Findings were documented and escalated to the incident response team, improving detection and prevention.
This hunt demonstrates hypothesis-driven methodologies and proactive threat identification.
